---
import {site} from '../data/site';
---
<section class="rankings" data-ranking-url={import.meta.env.PUBLIC_RANKINGS_URL || 'https://storage.googleapis.com/glob2-website-public-pharaoh-418820/rankings/v1.json'}><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Multiplayer</p><h2>Online player ratings</h2></div><span class="badge">Ranked 1v1 · OpenSkill</span></div><p>OpenSkill ratings from engine-verified ranked 1v1 matches. Provisional ratings mean the system is still learning a player’s skill. These are separate from tournament standings.</p><p class="ranking-status" role="status">Ratings load when JavaScript is enabled. If the feed is unavailable, try again later.</p><div class="ranking-table" hidden><table><caption class="sr-only">Public Online player ratings</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Rank</th><th scope="col">Player</th><th scope="col">Rating</th><th scope="col">Games</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div><p class="ranking-updated"></p><p><a class="text-link" href={site.leaderboardUrl}>See live leaderboards ↗</a></p><noscript><p>The live ratings feed requires JavaScript. All player guides and tournament announcements are available without it.</p></noscript></section>
<script>import '../scripts/rankings';</script>
